  <wpt lat="49.4407592037266" lon="-115.04053699182715">
    <name>Route Alternative</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>Riders can choose to take gravel foresty roads (Morrissey FSR, River Road) north into Fernie instead of these trail options. There are a couple of washouts but they are passable on bike. Below is link to the routing  into Fernie.</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>checkpoint</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="50.02253958048179" lon="-114.92399718709633">
